This kit's DDEV sidecar builds on ddev-claude by Hamza Makraz,
https://github.com/makraz/ddev-claude, at version v0.4.2.

The files under ddev-sidecar/overlay/overwrite/ replace the add-on's files
of the same names and are derived from them:

    .ddev/config.claude.yaml
    .ddev/claude/Dockerfile.base
    .ddev/claude/init-firewall.sh
    .ddev/commands/host/claude

